WEBVTT

00:02:28.987 --> 00:02:31.000
Let me give you an example.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:32.913
My friend Manya,

00:02:32.913 --> 00:02:35.962
when she was a student at university in California,

00:02:35.962 --> 00:02:37.660
was earning money

00:02:37.660 --> 00:02:40.720
by working for a car dealer.

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:42.531
Now, Manya, when she encountered

00:02:42.531 --> 00:02:45.389
the typical customer, would debate with him

00:02:45.389 --> 00:02:47.233
about his lifestyle,

00:02:47.233 --> 00:02:49.956
how much he wants to spend,

00:02:49.956 --> 00:02:51.700
how many children he has,

00:02:51.700 --> 00:02:53.973
what does he need the car for?

00:02:53.973 --> 00:02:56.660
They would usually come to a good conclusion

00:02:56.660 --> 00:02:59.214
what would be a perfect car.

00:02:59.214 --> 00:03:02.702
Now, before Manya's customer would go home